# Nudgeio GTM Feature List — The Exceptional Engineering OS

> **Strategy:** Position as the **Evidence-First Engineering Diagnosis System** — not another dashboard, not another "ask AI" product. Every feature listed here either (a) is genuinely unsolved by all 10+ tracked competitors, or (b) is a table-stakes capability done with a material quality gap that creates switching energy.

